# The recipe corpus is ~620MB — past GitHub's 100MB hard limit for a single file.
# It is regenerated outside this repo; see README.md for how to obtain it.
# ingredients.db (0.3MB) and recipes_test.db (1.4MB) stay tracked on purpose.
/app/src/main/assets/recipes.db
/recipes.db

# Backup of the previous (pre-port) recipes.db, kept outside app/ so it's
# never bundled into an APK build.
/db-backup/

# The new recipe corpus (odunola/foodie + hand-curated category taxonomy) is ~127MB --
# also past GitHub's 100MB hard limit. Built/regenerated via the scripts in
# porting-reference/ (see INGREDIENT_MATCHING_CONCEPTS.md and NEW_CORPUS_DATA_QUALITY.md);
# the bundled copy is the build output of the porting-reference copy, not a second source.
/app/src/main/assets/database/recipe_database.sqlite
/porting-reference/recipe_database.sqlite

# Python bytecode cache from running the porting-reference/ scripts.
__pycache__/
